[by: LRCLIB contributors (timing) and Lyrical Nonsense contributors (lyrics)]
[00:21.43] Yubi de hiku koin mitsumeta
[00:26.88] Omote nara GO, ura wa STAY. mazu kotae wo kikasete
[00:34.06] 
[00:36.96] "Douka oshiete kuremasen ka?"
[00:42.44] Tenshi wa misadameru egao no mama
[00:49.82] 
[00:52.40] Mayoe! sono te wo hiku mono nado inai
[00:58.19] Kami ga kudasu sono kotae wa fukou datta
[01:03.22] Sou sore koso kami kara no okurimono
[01:08.68] Norikoetara miete kuru sa dakara ima sugu
[01:15.35] "Look for it by oneself, no buts about it."
[01:15.93] No buts!
[01:18.24] 
[01:29.41] Naraberareta kaado mekutta
[01:35.42] Hohoenderu sono jookaa ketsumatsu wo kataranai
[01:42.68] 
[01:45.49] "Kore wa tengoku yuki no chiketto?"
[01:50.67] Doukeshi wa kikanu furi de odoketa
[01:57.89] 
[02:00.85] Sakebe! ima yuku kono michi shika nai to
[02:06.34] Tayorinai mune sono kokoro wo naguritsukete
[02:11.62] Aa fukou ni kizukasareta shiawase
[02:16.95] Norikoenakya miete konai dakara ima sugu
[02:24.08] 
[02:26.80] No buts!
[02:33.48] "Get it over oneself, no buts about it."
[02:38.26] "Look for it by oneself, no buts about it."
[02:41.98] "When getting it over, you understand it."
